1) Identify
-----------
I would just like to ask a question, in the Thread "How to identify
things that are not in the good order in my inventory" :
Why don't you use the !fixenv option ? This let you order your
inventory as you wish.
The only think that you have to take care of if you play fast is to
have your most useful items in slots a, b, c ... so that you don't
accidently change their name when you drop another item.

Just my 0.02$.

